5:/// gh-1412 IT-1: the FinalizeGate end-to-end with the fake-agent harness —
6:/// a scripted mock-LLM "agent" runs the real CLI with REAL bash against a
7:/// fixture task, and deliberately "forgets" the executable bit first. The
8:/// run must persist a hidden `task_ledger` session record whose
9:/// verification commands actually executed (the `test -x` fail → fix →
10:/// re-verify loop is visible in the session tool records), and the
11:/// produced state must end up correct.
12:///
